{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfae What is Ollsgar\u2019d?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc9c Ollsgar\u2019d is a bold and hilarious reimagining of the classic marbles game, now turned into a wild, challenging, voice\u2011controlled experience!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfa4 HOW IT WORKS?<br>\ud83d\udce2 Speak, sing, shout, or make any sound to launch your marble and score!<br>\ud83c\udfb8 Instruments, claps, your dog barking, grandma\u2019s laughter\u2026 any sound can be your controller.<br>If it makes noise, you can play!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd25 MARBLE BATTLE MODE<br>\ud83d\udca5 Face up to 999 rounds of pure challenge, noise, and vocal strategy.<br>\ud83d\udca3 The Arena is way too small for all that craziness: balance is everything!<br>\ud83c\udf08 Aim for the legendary Round 999+ to earn the title of Marble Master!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udca1 Simple to learn. Impossible to forget.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full voice-and-sound control</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chaotic, funny gameplay modes</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique style with humor, challenge, and sound creativity</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Perfect for laughing with friends (or screaming solo \ud83d\ude02)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc9c Get ready for the craziest game your throat has ever faced!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694660/extras/0148d77e79baf12978c7a3a6ad90ed20.poster.avif?t=1767052759\" w